<i>Operation and additional measure may be needed if the doctor finds something unexpected</i><br><br>
Operasi / tindakan ini kemungkinan tidak memberikan hasil yang sesuai harapan walaupun sudah dilakukan sesuai standar prosedur yang berlaku<br>
<i>The operation / action is likely not deliver result as expected, despite being carried out according to standart procedures</i>]]></text>
